<title>USA: Integrated Systems files for stock offer.</title>
<headline>Integrated Systems files for stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Integrated Systems Consulting Group Inc on Monday said it filed a registration statement on behalf of selling shareholders for an offering of 2,012,500 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The offering includes 262,500 shares subject to an underwriters' over-allotment option, the company said.</p>
<p>The offering will be co-managed by J.P. Morgan &amp; Co and Robert W. Baird &amp; Co Inc, Integrated Systems said.</p>
